Unit 2: UX vs UI
================

UX (User Experience)	                      UI (User Interface)
====================                        =================== 
Focuses on user experience                  Focuses on the visual interface
How the system works	                      How the system looks
User satisfaction	                          Design appearance
Logic and usability	                        Colors, buttons, layouts
Flow and interaction	                      Graphics and controls
Research-based	                            Design-based

Which is more Important?
=======================
Both are important.
•	Good UI + Bad UX → Beautiful but frustrating 
•	Good UX + Bad UI → Useful but unattractive 
•	Good UX + Good UI → Professional software

